    affiliation: "University of Oulu"
abstract: >-
  A per-super-enhancer, per-group specificity score (CaCTS for super-enhancers) computed from public H3K27ac
  ChIP-seq of cancer cell lines, with copy-number-aware calling and scoring and a label-permutation false
  discovery rate. Release v3.1: 2,188 untreated or control experiments on 510 cell lines; 13,754 lineage-specific,
  15,699 disease-specific and 10,971 subtype-specific super-enhancers at FDR <= 0.10, each a super-enhancer in its
  own group and labelled by how it depends on copy number. Includes the pipeline code and a static dashboard of the
  results.
keywords:
  - super-enhancer
  - H3K27ac
  - ChIP-seq
  - copy number
  - cancer cell lines
  - epigenomics
